<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-LATEST FRENCH OPEN MEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LATEST FRENCH OPEN MEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results in the</p>
<p>French Open tennis tournament on Monday.</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding</p>
<p>* Denotes new result</p>
<p>First round:</p>
<p>*Thierry Champion (France) beat Stephane Huet (France)  5-7 4-6</p>
<p>7-5 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>*Cedric Pioline (France) beat Oliver Gross (Germany) 6-4 6-4 3-6</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>*Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) beat Javier Frana (Argentina) 6-4</p>
<p>6-7 (3-7) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>*Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 6-2 6-1 4-6</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>*Jens Knippschild (Germany) beat David Prinosil (Germany) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4 3-6 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>*Guillaume Raoux (France) beat Vincent Spadea (U.S.) 6-2 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) beat Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) 6-0</p>
<p>7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) beat Greg Rusedski (Britain) 6-3 6-2 3-6</p>
<p>4-6 9-7</p>
<p>Gaston Etlis (Argentina) beat Wolfgang Schranz (Austria)  6-4</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Martin Damm (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-2 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Leander Paes (India) beat Grant Stafford (South Africa) 6-4 3-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Ramon Delgado (Paraguay) beat Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) 2-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Lionel Roux (France) beat Andrei Merinov (Russia) 6-0 6-2  7-6</p>
<p>(12-10)</p>
</text>
